      en: ["Founded in the year 1042.", "The name 'Pohyon' is derived from the Bodhisattva Samantabhadra.", "Contains a copy of the Tripitaka Koreana woodblocks.", "The four-tiered Manse Bridge leads to the temple entrance.", "The Chogye Gate, the main gate, was built in the 17th century.", "One of the five famous temples of Korea.", "The temple was burned down during the 16th-century Japanese invasions."]
